# Title: Exchange PowerShell Snap-Ins Usage
# ID: 25676e10-2121-446e-80a4-71ff8506af47
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: FPT.EagleEye, Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2021-03-03
# Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1059.001, attack.collection, attack.t1114
# Description: Detects adding and using Exchange PowerShell snap-ins to export mailbox data. As seen used by HAFNIUM and APT27
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((process.command_line:*Add-PSSnapin*) AND (((process.executable:*\\powershell.exe OR process.executable:*\\pwsh.exe)) OR ((process.pe.original_file_name:"PowerShell.EXE" OR process.pe.original_file_name:"pwsh.dll"))) AND ((process.command_line:*Microsoft.Exchange.Powershell.Snapin* OR process.command_line:*Microsoft.Exchange.Management.PowerShell.SnapIn*))) AND NOT ((process.parent.executable:"C:\\Windows\\System32\\msiexec.exe" AND process.command_line:*$exserver=Get-ExchangeServer ([Environment]::MachineName) -ErrorVariable exerr 2> $null*)))
